# fm84 po polsku.
#
# Each msgid is the English as the code has it, and the msgstr under it what
# is shown in its place. A sentence with a count in it has a msgstr for each
# form the count takes: [one] for 1 alone, [few] for 2-4, 22-24, 32-34...
# but not 12-14, [other] for the rest, 21 too. A msgctxt sets one use of a
# word apart from the same word elsewhere. {name} is a place the program
# fills, kept as it is. The letters to press - Y, N, A and the like - stay
# as they are, and so do the names of the keys. Names are quoted „thus”.

